### `email-notification.html`

Professional HTML email template with:

- **Corporate Branding**: Gainwell Technologies styling and logos
- **Email Client Compatibility**: Tested across Outlook, Gmail, Apple Mail, Thunderbird
- **Dark Mode Support**: Automatic adaptation via CSS media queries
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile and desktop email client optimization
- **Content Sections**: Automatically hide empty sections using CSS data attributes

**Template Variables** (Handlebars-style):

```handlebars
{{HEADER_TITLE}}
# Notification title
{{PLATFORM}}
# Deployment platform (AWS EKS)
{{ENVIRONMENT}}
# Target environment (dev/prod)
{{DEPLOYED_URL}}
# Live site URL
{{TOTAL_CHANGES}}
# Total changed files count
{{ADR_COUNT}}
# Architecture Decision Records count
{{STRATEGY_COUNT}}
# Strategic documents count
{{DOMAINS_COUNT}}
# Domain architecture documents count
{{SYNC_DESCRIPTION}}
# Deployment mode description
```
